      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. i'm seeing a lot of different takes in the news though. some people are saying these investigations are basically inevitable because of how much power these companies have, while others are calling it a political witch hunt. in your opinion as a tech journalist, do you think the current regulatory approach is actually well-founded or is it just a reaction to the popularity of these companies?",
